      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Upload all the sheets (in bulk) (scanned or downloaded pdf)\n2. verify the QR codes and barcodes with file name.\n3. upload on the server with backend APIs\n\n\nRequirements\nElectronJS\nPDF readers, QR code, barcode readers (JS libs) (\n        issues -> positioning of codes, resolution, quality and versioning pdf\nBackend APIs (from exam-server)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Upload all the sheets (in bulk) (scanned or downloaded pdf)\n2. verify the QR codes and barcodes with file name.\n3. upload on the server with backend APIs\n\n\nRequirements\nElectronJS\nPDF readers, QR code, barcode readers (JS libs) (\n        issues -> positioning of codes, resolution, quality and versioning pdf\nBackend APIs (from exam-server)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
