      "updated": 1769810990685,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "failure cases\npage count is less / more than expected - student roll number, course code\nQR code not detected / Partial detection - Mention Page Numbers, student roll number, course code\nTampering detected (mismatch) - QR Code / Barcode mismatched on page numbers (compare it with the file name) - Student roll number, course code\nQR codes damaged - page numbers, student roll number, course code\nsheet uploaded does not belong to selected date and time slot (match subjectId)\nfile is already scanned successfully - course code, student roll number\nsomeone changes the QR (pdf edited) - course code, student roll number",
      "fontSize": 27.56368345835696,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "failure cases\npage count is less / more than expected - student roll number, course code\nQR code not detected / Partial detection - Mention Page Numbers, student roll number, course code\nTampering detected (mismatch) - QR Code / Barcode mismatched on page numbers (compare it with the file name) - Student roll number, course code\nQR codes damaged - page numbers, student roll number, course code\nsheet uploaded does not belong to selected date and time slot (match subjectId)\nfile is already scanned successfully - course code, student roll number\nsomeone changes the QR (pdf edited) - course code, student roll number",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
