    {
      "id": "94_YfqfGVjKH875piPp5D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1060.5195798408258,
      "y": 415.7872717391842,
      "width": 967.5396728515625,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#fa5252",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 942529188,
      "version": 867,
      "versionNonce": 2077935260,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769810990685,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Authentication \n2. Fetch the exam notifications from DB (GET)\n3. Select one notification\n    Continue -> Fetch all the Subject Lists and complete details (GET)\n4. Select one date and time slot -> Fetch the Students List (GET)\n5. Selected files\n    File names sent to DB for pre process verification (POST)\n    Based on response files are filtered\n    Scan -> Success -> Compression\n    Upload to DB (POST) (Overwrite existing too)\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Authentication \n2. Fetch the exam notifications from DB (GET)\n3. Select one notification\n    Continue -> Fetch all the Subject Lists and complete details (GET)\n4. Select one date and time slot -> Fetch the Students List (GET)\n5. Selected files\n    File names sent to DB for pre process verification (POST)\n    Based on response files are filtered\n    Scan -> Success -> Compression\n    Upload to DB (POST) (Overwrite existing too)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
