      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770099020845,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Positive / negative test cases?\nError Handler?\nshow errors very specific and detailed\nroll number\nOnly one search input for table\nLoading screens on every page\nRethink for hovering cards\nThink of compression algos\nStore logs for errors / success\nreturn stud-external id in PP API\nerror on reuploading with different file is missing\nLoading screens for every page\nDo we need to show uploads or only logs?\nCourse Name, Roll Number, Subject Code, Branch code\nprint connect app (check once)\ncount the attempt in logs too",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Positive / negative test cases?\nError Handler?\nshow errors very specific and detailed\nroll number\nOnly one search input for table\nLoading screens on every page\nRethink for hovering cards\nThink of compression algos\nStore logs for errors / success\nreturn stud-external id in PP API\nerror on reuploading with different file is missing\nLoading screens for every page\nDo we need to show uploads or only logs?\nCourse Name, Roll Number, Subject Code, Branch code\nprint connect app (check once)\ncount the attempt in logs too",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
