    {
      "id": "LbuoBfxdpnEWUA3I5yHcn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2387.657420875499,
      "y": 84.8868215184284,
      "width": 593.8598022460938,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 287872804,
      "version": 701,
      "versionNonce": 291959204,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769810990685,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collect all the booklets logs for same course\ncreate an array  of length === total page count in booklet\narr = []\nretry_files = []\nfor page of each file\n    for each page\n        arr[page][codesCount] = max(arr[page][codesCount],\n                                             file[page][codesCount])\n\nfor file of files:\n    for page of each file:\n        if page[codesCount] != arr[page][codesCount]:\n            retry_files.append(file)\n\nnow retry with expected result === arr",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Collect all the booklets logs for same course\ncreate an array  of length === total page count in booklet\narr = []\nretry_files = []\nfor page of each file\n    for each page\n        arr[page][codesCount] = max(arr[page][codesCount],\n                                             file[page][codesCount])\n\nfor file of files:\n    for page of each file:\n        if page[codesCount] != arr[page][codesCount]:\n            retry_files.append(file)\n\nnow retry with expected result === arr",
